Package: covarchimax
Type: Package
Title: Covariate-Dependent Clayton-Archimax Copulas for Spatial Extremes
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Ziyi (Ellen)", "Zhou", email = "ellen.zy.syuu@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Semiparametric inference for Clayton-Archimax copulas with
    covariate-dependent Pickands dependence functions. Implements the
    moment-based estimator of the Clayton generator parameter and its
    asymptotic variance (Chatelain, Fougeres and Neslehova, 2020), the
    Pickands-type, CFG-type and a new maximum-likelihood estimator of the
    Pickands dependence function in arbitrary dimension, a linear and a
    logit-link covariate model for A(omega | z) evaluated pointwise on the
    unit simplex, a conditional-inversion sampler, and the non-stationary
    GEV margin tooling used to analyse precipitation extremes at six
    stations in southern Quebec (1930-2017).
